船の木の香り、そして…懐かしい友の気配を感じる…","nextNodeIds":[745230402]},{"nodeId":745230402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":186372394,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、変わりないでござるか？","nextNodeIds":[745230403,745230404]},{"nodeId":745230403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":599526538,"text":"万葉、久しぶりだね。","nextNodeIds":[745230405]},{"nodeId":745230405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":3294541802,"text":"「南十字」船隊が補給のため稲妻に停泊しておってな。せっかくの帰郷ゆえ、方々を巡り、故郷の景色をいま一度目に焼き付け、吹く風の音に耳を澄まそうとしていたところでござる。","nextNodeIds":[745230406]},{"nodeId":745230406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2985253962,"text":"離島の風は、どこよりも騒がしい…別れと再会、希望と迷いが入り混じり…多くの物語を運んでくる。","nextNodeIds":[745230407,745230408]},{"nodeId":745230407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":342112058,"text":"写真を撮らせてくれる？","nextNodeIds":[745230409]},{"nodeId":745230409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":1167606498,"text":"ふふ、万物には形があるもの…風もまた然り。されど風の姿というものは、木の葉が舞い、波が立ち、あるいは旅人の衣がはためいた、その一瞬にしか見えぬもの。","nextNodeIds":[745230410]},{"nodeId":745230410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2079867962,"text":"拙者の姿を通して、「風の形」を捉えてもらえれば幸いでござる。","nextNodeIds":[745230411,745230412]},{"nodeId":745230411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1331037114,"text":"じゃあ、始めるよ。","nextNodeIds":[745230413]},{"nodeId":745230413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30911,"speakerName":"楓原万葉","textMapHash":2483604786,"text":"うむ、お主の手で、この刹那の詩を集めるがよい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745230412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1633043394,"text":"さっきみたいに、風を感じててね。","nextNodeIds":[745230413]},{"nodeId":745230408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1482711018,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}もこの風を残したいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[745230409]},{"nodeId":745230404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":479640002,"text":"どうしてここに？","nextNodeIds":[745230405]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452301"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7452302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":1601891044,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7452301,4],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7452301,4],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452302"},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,10],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"[3_14710:-2448.033,246.763,-3895.892]"}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_IS_GAME_TIME_LOCKED_V2"}],"guide"